"text":{"en":"You're not from here, are you? There have been more people on the road than usual lately. They say the Church is calling for pilgrims.","zh":"你是外地来的吧？这阵子路上的人比往年多，听说是教会在召朝圣的人。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Every sack of grain is weighed first, and the granary takes its share before we get ours. This year, after that, we have half a sack left.","zh":"麦子收上来先过秤，交够粮仓的份才轮到自家。今年交完，家里就剩小半袋。"}}]}}},{"id":"tithe.scalemoor-mill.folk1.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.scalemoor-mill.folk1"}},{"id":"tithe.scalemoor-mill.folk1.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.scalemoor-mill.folk1"}},{"id":"tithe.scalemoor-mill.folk1.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.scalemoor-mill.folk1"}},{"id":"tithe.scalemoor-mill.folk1.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.scalemoor-mill.folk1"}},{"id":"tithe.scalemoor-mill.folk1.coin4","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.scalemoor-mill.folk1"}},{"id":"tithe.scalemoor-mill.folk1.coin5","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"tithe.scalemoor-mill.folk1"}}]}